                ('Why not just use ChatGPT for the 40 messages?', 'You can, and an assistant often does better on language, as the twelve-message run in Session 12 will show. A tree or neighbour model is cheap, explainable and runs on your own computer. Compare them on your own messages.'),
                ('How many examples do I need?', 'There is no fixed number. It depends on how varied the cases are. Forty messages in four categories was too few for text. More varied examples help more than more of the same.'),
